u se", "en": "they returned", "bn": "তারা ফিরে এল", "fa": "بازگشتند", "fr": "sont revenus", "id": "mereka kembali", "tr": "döndüler", "ur": "وہ لوٹے"}}, {"arabic": "إِلَى", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "u", "en": "to", "bn": "দিকে", "fa": "به", "fr": "à", "id": "ke", "tr": "-e kadar", "ur": "کی طرف"}}, {"arabic": "الْمَدْرَسَةِ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "školu", "en": "the school", "bn": "স্কুল", "fa": "مدرسه", "fr": "l'école", "id": "sekolah itu", "tr": "okul", "ur": "اسکول"}}]}, {"arabic": "يَعُودُونَ مَسَاءً", "spoken": "audio/a83956370142265bc577.m4a", "tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "translation": {"bs": "Vraćaju se navečer.", "en": "They come back in the evening.", "bn": "তারা সন্ধ্যায় ফিরে আসে।", "fa": "عصر برمی‌گردند.", "fr": "Ils reviennent le soir.", "id": "Mereka kembali pada sore hari.", "tr": "Akşamleyin dönerler.", "ur": "وہ شام کو لوٹ آتے ہیں۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "يَعُودُونَ", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "vraćaju se", "en": "they return", "bn": "তারা ফিরে আসে", "fa": "بازمی‌گردند", "fr": "reviennent", "id": "mereka kembali", "tr": "dönerler", "ur": "وہ لوٹتے ہیں"}}, {"arabic": "مَسَاءً", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "navečer", "en": "in the evening", "bn": "সন্ধ্যায়", "fa": "عصر", "fr": "le soir", "id": "pada sore hari", "tr": "akşamleyin", "ur": "شام کو"}}]}, {"arabic": "عُدْنَا إِلَى الْبَيْتِ", "spoken": "audio/c13f214c031209cd9d95.m4a", "tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "translation": {"bs": "Vratili smo se kući.", "en": "We went back home.", "bn": "আমরা বাড়ি ফিরে গেলাম।", "fa": "به خانه برگشتیم.", "fr": "Nous sommes rentrés à la maison.", "id": "Kami kembali ke rumah.", "tr": "Eve döndük.", "ur": "ہم گھر لوٹ آئے۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "عُدْنَا", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "vratili smo se", "en": "we returned", "bn": "আমরা ফিরে এলাম", "fa": "بازگشتیم", "fr": "nous sommes revenus", "id": "kami kembali", "tr": "dönd